{{Quote|Provides the ability to create shockwaves, dealing massive area damage.|Shop}}
'''Quake''' is a {{Legendary}} [[Natural]]-type [[Blox Fruit]] that costs {{Money|1,000,000}} or {{Robux|1,500}} from the [[Blox Fruit Dealer]].

Quake grants the user the ability to create shockwave attacks, causing devastating damage. With these powers, the user can cause tsunamis that can sweep away entire islands of enemies. 

==Awakening==
Quake costs {{Fragment|17,000}} to fully [[Raids|awaken]].

{{Title|The Strongest One}} (#033) [[Titles|title]] will be granted upon awakening at least one move of this fruit.

{{Awakening Price Table
|move1 = Z | 1,000
|move3 = X | 3,000
|move4 = C | 5,000
|move5 = V | 8,000
}}

